WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.779
Open your WhatsApp account, select Flows, then Create Flow

00:00:05.779 --> 00:00:08.651
Name it and pick a category

00:00:08.651 --> 00:00:14.668
Give the screen a title and edit its Short answer

00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:20.527
Click + to add a screen

00:00:20.527 --> 00:00:39.452
Add content adds text and questions, such as a dropdown

00:00:39.452 --> 00:00:42.175
The last screen's button sends every answer to the chat

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:53.901
Try it in the preview, as the customer would

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:56.760
The preview shows the message your assistant reads

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:03.274
View as JSON shows the Flow JSON Ringg sends to Meta

00:01:03.274 --> 00:01:06.939
Click Save draft

00:01:06.939 --> 00:01:11.014
The saved draft stays open for editing. Click Cancel to see its details

00:01:11.014 --> 00:01:15.901
Click Publish, then Publish again to confirm

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:21.118
Published Flows are locked. Duplicate & edit makes a new draft

00:01:21.118 --> 00:01:23.723
The copy opens in the builder, named (copy)
